  lift*-dist-compᴿˢ-var b zero {x = x} {ξ = ξ} {σ = σ} = sym (compositionalityᴿˢ-⨟-var {x = x} {ξ = ξ} {σ = σ})
  lift*-dist-compᴿˢ-var b (suc n) {x = x} {ξ = ξ} {σ = σ} =
